{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# PDF đề toán -> Markdown + Images -> TeX bằng MinerU\\n",
        "\\n",
        "Notebook này dùng cho Google Colab. Mục tiêu là OCR các PDF đề toán bằng MinerU, chuẩn hóa ảnh theo từng câu hỏi, rồi sinh Markdown và TeX.\\n",
        "\\n",
        "Output chính nằm trong `/content/outputs/final` gồm `markdown/`, `tex/`, `images/` và `image_mapping.json`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. Cài đặt\\n",
        "\\n",
        "Trước khi chạy, vào `Runtime > Change runtime type` và chọn GPU nếu Colab cho phép. MinerU có thể cài lâu trong lần đầu."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import os, sys, subprocess, textwrap\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def run_shell(cmd):\\n",
        "    print(f'\\n$ {cmd}')\\n",
        "    subprocess.run(cmd, shell=True, check=True)\\n",
        "\\n",
        "run_shell(f'{sys.executable} -m pip install -q -U pip')\\n",
        "run_shell(f'{sys.executable} -m pip install -q -U \"mineru[all]\" pymupdf pillow python-slugify')\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 2. Cấu hình đường dẫn và danh sách PDF\\n",
        "\\n",
        "Bạn có thể upload trực tiếp 4 PDF ở cell tiếp theo, hoặc mount Google Drive rồi sửa `INPUT_DIR`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from pathlib import Path\\n",
        "\\n",
        "INPUT_DIR = Path('/content/input_pdfs')\\n",
        "RAW_DIR = Path('/content/outputs/mineru_raw')\\n",
        "FINAL_DIR = Path('/content/outputs/final')\\n",
        "MD_DIR = FINAL_DIR / 'markdown'\\n",
        "TEX_DIR = FINAL_DIR / 'tex'\\n",
        "IMG_DIR = FINAL_DIR / 'images'\\n",
        "\\n",
        "PDF_FILES = [\\n",
        "    'Đề 01.pdf',\\n",
        "    'Đề 3 HSG.pdf',\\n",
        "    'Cau truc de thi HSG 10.pdf',\\n",
        "    '10-HSG-TRẤN BIÊN 2026-AZOTA.pdf',\\n",
        "]\\n",
        "\\n",
        "for d in [INPUT_DIR, RAW_DIR, FINAL_DIR, MD_DIR, TEX_DIR, IMG_DIR]:\\n",
        "    d.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n",
        "\\n",
        "print('INPUT_DIR =', INPUT_DIR)\\n",
        "print('FINAL_DIR =', FINAL_DIR)\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from google.colab import files\\n",
        "\\n",
        "uploaded = files.upload()\\n",
        "for name, data in uploaded.items():\\n",
        "    target = INPUT_DIR / name\\n",
        "    target.write_bytes(data)\\n",
        "    print('Saved', target)\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 3. Hàm chạy MinerU và tìm output\\n",
        "\\n",
        "Nếu Colab không có GPU hoặc MinerU báo thiếu tài nguyên, đặt `USE_CPU_PIPELINE = True`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import json, re, shutil, subprocess\\n",
        "from collections import defaultdict\\n",
        "from urllib.parse import unquote\\n",
        "from slugify import slugify\\n",
        "\\n",
        "USE_CPU_PIPELINE = False\\n",
        "IMAGE_EXTS = {'.png', '.jpg', '.jpeg', '.webp', '.bmp'}\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def doc_slug(pdf_path):\\n",
        "    return slugify(Path(pdf_path).stem, lowercase=True) or 'document'\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def run_mineru(pdf_path):\\n",
        "    pdf_path = Path(pdf_path)\\n",
        "    out_dir = RAW_DIR / doc_slug(pdf_path)\\n",
        "    out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n",
        "    cmd = ['mineru', '-p', str(pdf_path), '-o', str(out_dir)]\\n",
        "    if USE_CPU_PIPELINE:\\n",
        "        cmd += ['-b', 'pipeline']\\n",
        "    print('Running:', ' '.join(cmd))\\n",
        "    result = subprocess.run(cmd, text=True, capture_output=True)\\n",
        "    print(result.stdout[-4000:])\\n",
        "    if result.returncode != 0:\\n",
        "        print(result.stderr[-4000:])\\n",
        "        raise RuntimeError(f'MinerU failed for {pdf_path.name}')\\n",
        "    return out_dir\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def find_markdown(raw_doc_dir):\\n",
        "    candidates = list(Path(raw_doc_dir).rglob('*.md'))\\n",
        "    if not candidates:\\n",
        "        raise FileNotFoundError(f'No Markdown found in {raw_doc_dir}')\\n",
        "    candidates.sort(key=lambda p: p.stat().st_size, reverse=True)\\n",
        "    return candidates[0]\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def locate_image(src, md_dir, raw_doc_dir):\\n",
        "    s = unquote(str(src)).strip().strip('"').strip(\"'\")\\n",
        "    if s.startswith(('http://', 'https://', 'data:')):\\n",
        "        return None\\n",
        "    s = s.split('#')[0].split('?')[0]\\n",
        "    direct = (md_dir / s).resolve()\\n",
        "    if direct.exists():\\n",
        "        return direct\\n",
        "    direct = (Path(raw_doc_dir) / s).resolve()\\n",
        "    if direct.exists():\\n",
        "        return direct\\n",
        "    name = Path(s).name\\n",
        "    matches = [p for p in Path(raw_doc_dir).rglob(name) if p.suffix.lower() in IMAGE_EXTS]\\n",
        "    return matches[0] if matches else None\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 4. Chuẩn hóa Markdown và mapping ảnh theo câu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "question_re = re.compile(r'(?:\\*\\*)?\\s*C[âa]u\\s*(\\d+)', re.IGNORECASE)\\n",
        "md_img_re = re.compile(r'!\\[[^\\]]*\\]\\(([^)]+)\\)')\\n",
        "html_img_re = re.compile(r'<img[^>]+src=[\\\"\\']([^\\\"\\']+)[\\\"\\'][^>]*>', re.IGNORECASE)\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def normalize_markdown_and_images(pdf_path, raw_doc_dir):\\n",
        "    pdf_path = Path(pdf_path)\\n",
        "    slug = doc_slug(pdf_path)\\n",
        "    md_path = find_markdown(raw_doc_dir)\\n",
        "    text = md_path.read_text(encoding='utf-8', errors='ignore')\\n",
        "    current_question = 'unknown'\\n",
        "    image_counts = defaultdict(int)\\n",
        "    mappings = []\\n",
        "    out_lines = []\\n",
        "\\n",
        "    def replace_one(src):\\n",
        "        nonlocal current_question\\n",
        "        src_path = locate_image(src, md_path.parent, raw_doc_dir)\\n",
        "        if src_path is None:\\n",
        "            return src\\n",
        "        q = current_question or 'unknown'\\n",
        "        image_counts[q] += 1\\n",
        "        q_label = f'cau{int(q):02d}' if str(q).isdigit() else 'unknown'\\n",
        "        new_name = f'{slug}_{q_label}_{image_counts[q]:02d}{src_path.suffix.lower()}'\\n",
        "        dest = IMG_DIR / new_name\\n",
        "        shutil.copy2(src_path, dest)\\n",
        "        mappings.append({\\n",
        "            'document': pdf_path.name,\\n",
        "            'document_slug': slug,\\n",
        "            'question': q,\\n",
        "            'image': new_name,\\n",
        "            'source_image': str(src_path),\\n",
        "            'markdown_path': f'../images/{new_name}'\\n",
        "        })\\n",
        "        return f'../images/{new_name}'\\n",
        "\\n",
        "    for line in text.splitlines():\\n",
        "        m = question_re.search(line)\\n",
        "        if m:\\n",
        "            current_question = m.group(1)\\n",
        "        line = md_img_re.sub(lambda mm: f'![image]({replace_one(mm.group(1))})', line)\\n",
        "        line = html_img_re.sub(lambda mm: f'![image]({replace_one(mm.group(1))})', line)\\n",
        "        out_lines.append(line)\\n",
        "\\n",
        "    out_md = MD_DIR / f'{slug}.md'\\n",
        "    out_md.write_text('\\n'.join(out_lines).strip() + '\\n', encoding='utf-8')\\n",
        "    return out_md, mappings\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 5. Chuyển Markdown sang TeX"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "math_re = re.compile(r'(\\$\\$.*?\\$\\$|\\$.*?\\$|\\\\\\[.*?\\\\\\]|\\\\\\(.*?\\\\\\))', re.DOTALL)\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def escape_tex_text(s):\\n",
        "    repl = {\\n",
        "        '&': r'\\\\&', '%': r'\\\\%', '#': r'\\\\#', '_': r'\\\\_',\\n",
        "        '{': r'\\\\{', '}': r'\\\\}', '~': r'\\\\textasciitilde{}', '^': r'\\\\textasciicircum{}'\\n",
        "    }\\n",
        "    return ''.join(repl.get(ch, ch) for ch in s)\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def markdown_inline_to_tex(line):\\n",
        "    line = line.replace('**', '')\\n",
        "    pieces = math_re.split(line)\\n",
        "    out = []\\n",
        "    for piece in pieces:\\n",
        "        if not piece:\\n",
        "            continue\\n",
        "        if math_re.fullmatch(piece):\\n",
        "            out.append(piece)\\n",
        "        else:\\n",
        "            out.append(escape_tex_text(piece))\\n",
        "    return ''.join(out)\\n",
        "\\n",
        "def markdown_to_tex(md_path, title=None):\\n",
        "    md_path = Path(md_path)\\n",
        "    title = title or md_path.stem\\n",
        "    lines = md_path.read_text(encoding='utf-8').splitlines()\\n",
        "    tex_lines = []\\n",
        "    for line in lines:\\n",
        "        raw = line.strip()\\n",
        "        if not raw:\\n",
        "            tex_lines.append('')\\n",
        "            continue\\n",
        "        img = md_img_re.search(raw)\\n",
        "        if img:\\n",
        "            img_path = img.group(1).replace('\\\\', '/')\\n",
        "            tex_lines.append(r'\\begin{center}')\\n",
        "            tex_lines.append(r'\\includegraphics[width=0.82\\linewidth]{' + img_path + '}')\\n",
        "            tex_lines.append(r'\\end{center}')\\n",
        "            continue\\n",
        "        if raw.startswith('#'):\\n",
        "            level = len(raw) - len(raw.lstrip('#'))\\n",
        "            heading = markdown_inline_to_tex(raw[level:].strip())\\n",
        "            cmd = 'section*' if level <= 1 else 'subsection*'\\n",
        "            tex_lines.append(f'\\\\{cmd}' + '{' + heading + '}')\\n",
        "            continue\\n",
        "        q = question_re.match(raw)\\n",
        "        if q:\\n",
        "            tex_lines.append('\\n' + r'\\medskip')\\n",
        "            tex_lines.append(r'\\noindent ' + markdown_inline_to_tex(raw) + r'\\par')\\n",
        "            continue\\n",
        "        tex_lines.append(markdown_inline_to_tex(raw) + r'\\par')\\n",
        "\\n",
        "    preamble = rf'''\\documentclass[12pt,a4paper]{{article}}\\n",
        "\\usepackage{{fontspec}}\\n",
        "\\usepackage[vietnamese]{{babel}}\\n",
        "\\usepackage{{amsmath,amssymb,mathtools}}\\n",
        "\\usepackage{{graphicx}}\\n",
        "\\usepackage{{geometry}}\\n",
        "\\usepackage{{enumitem}}\\n",
        "\\geometry{{margin=2cm}}\\n",
        "\\setmainfont{{TeX Gyre Termes}}\\n",
        "\\setlength{{\\parindent}}{{0pt}}\\n",
        "\\setlength{{\\parskip}}{{4pt}}\\n",
        "\\begin{{document}}\\n",
        "\\begin{{center}}\\n",
        "{{\\Large\\bfseries {escape_tex_text(title)}}}\\n",
        "\\end{{center}}\\n",
        "'''\\n",
        "    ending = '\\n\\\\end{document}\\n'\\n",
        "    tex = preamble + '\\n'.join(tex_lines) + ending\\n",
        "    out_tex = TEX_DIR / f'{md_path.stem}.tex'\\n",
        "    out_tex.write_text(tex, encoding='utf-8')\\n",
        "    return out_tex\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 6. Chạy toàn bộ quy trình"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def run_all():\\n",
        "    all_mappings = []\\n",
        "    results = []\\n",
        "    for pdf_name in PDF_FILES:\\n",
        "        pdf_path = INPUT_DIR / pdf_name\\n",
        "        if not pdf_path.exists():\\n",
        "            print(f'Skip missing: {pdf_path}')\\n",
        "            continue\\n",
        "        print(f'\\n=== {pdf_name} ===')\\n",
        "        raw_doc_dir = run_mineru(pdf_path)\\n",
        "        out_md, mappings = normalize_markdown_and_images(pdf_path, raw_doc_dir)\\n",
        "        out_tex = markdown_to_tex(out_md, title=pdf_path.stem)\\n",
        "        all_mappings.extend(mappings)\\n",
        "        results.append({'pdf': str(pdf_path), 'markdown': str(out_md), 'tex': str(out_tex), 'images': len(mappings)})\\n",
        "        print('Markdown:', out_md)\\n",
        "        print('TeX:', out_tex)\\n",
        "        print('Images mapped:', len(mappings))\\n",
        "    (FINAL_DIR / 'image_mapping.json').write_text(json.dumps(all_mappings, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding='utf-8')\\n",
        "    (FINAL_DIR / 'run_summary.json').write_text(json.dumps(results, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding='utf-8')\\n",
        "    print('\\nDone. Final output:', FINAL_DIR)\\n",
        "    return results, all_mappings\\n",
        "\\n",
        "results, image_mapping = run_all()\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 7. Kiểm tra nhanh mapping ảnh"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\\n",
        "\\n",
        "df = pd.DataFrame(image_mapping)\\n",
        "display(df.head(50))\\n",
        "if not df.empty:\\n",
        "    display(df.groupby(['document', 'question']).size().reset_index(name='image_count'))\\n",
        "    unknown = df[df['question'].astype(str).eq('unknown')]\\n",
        "    print('Unknown mappings:', len(unknown))\\n",
        "    if len(unknown):\\n",
        "        display(unknown)\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 8. Nén output để tải về"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "shutil.make_archive('/content/pdf_to_tex_outputs', 'zip', FINAL_DIR)\\n",
        "files.download('/content/pdf_to_tex_outputs.zip')\\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 9. Tùy chọn biên dịch TeX trên Colab\\n",
        "\\n",
